# background-agent scratch: forge reads, command captures, MCP bridges, and run polling. Every
# shape below was written into the integration checkout by an agent running with the checkout as
# its working directory, so none of it is repository content. Keep it out of `git status`, or the
# branch line drowns in it and a fast-forward check reads noise instead of a change.
